The townspeople gathered at the door.
Jesus healed many of them. They all suffered from various diseases. He also drove out many demons. But he did not allow the demons to speak, because they knew who he was. Jesus prays in a quiet place.
It was very early in the morning and still dark. Jesus awoke and left the house. He went to a place where he could be alone. And there he prayed.
Samuel and his friends went to look for Jesus.
When they found him, they shouted: "Everyone is looking for you!"
Jesus answered and said, "Let us go to another place. I want to go to the neighboring cities. I must preach there also. This is the reason I have come."
