They will have the authorization to drive out spirits and demons.
Then Jesus appointed the twelve apostles. Simon was one of them. Jesus gave him the name Peter.
There was once a man, the son of Zehari, and his brother was John. And Jesus gave him the name Baranangros. Baranangros means Sons of Thunder.
